@startuml
title List All Tasks - Main Success Scenario

actor "Generic User" as User
participant Browser
participant Server
database "Persistence Model" as Persistence

User -> Browser : Click "viewAll" button
Browser -> Server : Send generic request (no filters)
Server -> Persistence : Query all tasks
Persistence --> Server : Return all tasks
Server -> Server : Render TaskView with task table
Server --> Browser : Respond with TaskView
Browser --> User : Display all tasks

@enduml